@startuml Health Flow - Clubinho NIB API
!theme plain
hide footbox

title Core — process health probe

actor "Load balancer / Client" as Client
participant AppController as Controller
participant "Node.js process" as Runtime

Client -> Controller : GET /health
Controller -> Runtime : read timestamp, uptime and environment
Runtime --> Controller : process values
Controller --> Client : 200 { status: "ok", ... }

note over Controller, Runtime
  Liveness only: this endpoint does not query MySQL, S3 or DynamoDB.
end note

@enduml
